Scope and limits

This licence covers the prose, tables and analysis written by the OpenHeilig
contributors — that is, our description of observed file formats and engine
behaviour.

It does not, and cannot, grant any rights in Sacred or Sacred Gold, which
remain the property of their respective rights holders. No game data, game
code, or machine-generated decompilation of game code is contained in this
repository.

Facts are not copyrightable, and these documents are offered as an independent
description of them for interoperability purposes. Where a document cites
third-party work — most notably github.com/SiENcE/Iris1 (GPL v2), consulted as
documentation only — that work remains under its own licence and none of its
code is reproduced here.
